 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.48,
   "end": 1.98,
   "text": "That was sort of my first introduction."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.11,
   "end": 3.3,
   "text": "I never expected to be in epidemiology."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.3,
   "end": 10.05,
   "text": "I started out wanting to be a teacher, and then I couldn't afford to go to school, and then when I could afford to go to"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.05,
   "end": 11.92,
   "text": "school, I thought, I'm going to be a clinical psychologist."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.04,
   "end": 13.25,
   "text": "So I went into psychology."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.25,
   "end": 19.98,
   "text": "One of the reasons I went into psychology was there was no math or science, or so I thought."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.52,
   "end": 27.32,
   "text": "The teaching assistant for that course really had a huge influence on my trajectory into the field of science."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.32,
   "end": 29.52,
   "text": "She got me through that course."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.52,
   "end": 35.23,
   "text": "She really helped me with statistics, but more than that, she said, look you need to be a research assistant."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.53,
   "end": 36.86,
   "text": "You need to get into the honors program."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.86,
   "end": 38.14,
   "text": "You need to be a teaching assistant."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.14,
   "end": 40.95,
   "text": "Here are the things you need to do to go forward."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.95,
   "end": 44.15,
   "text": "And without her, I don't think I would have done well."
  }
 ],
